# =============================================================================
# Cloudflare Workers & Pages — projet "dartchain" (monorepo GitHub)
# =============================================================================
#
# ERREUR COURANTE :
#   "Could not detect a directory containing static files"
# → Build command était "None" et deploy = wrangler sans dist/browser
#
# Dashboard : Workers & Pages → dartchain → Settings → Build
#
# | Champ              | Valeur                                      |
# |--------------------|---------------------------------------------|
# | Root directory     | /  (racine du repo)                         |
# | Build command      | bash scripts/cloudflare-build.sh            |
# | Deploy command     | npx wrangler deploy                         |
# | Node.js version    | 22                                          |
#
# Build variables (obligatoire) :
BACKEND_URL=https://YOUR-BACKEND.onrender.com
#
# Fichiers repo utilisés :
#   wrangler.toml              → pages_build_output_dir = dist/browser
#   scripts/cloudflare-build.sh → npm ci + build Angular
#
# =============================================================================
# Alternative : Pages classique (sans wrangler deploy)
# =============================================================================
#
# Create application → Pages → Connect to Git
# Root directory     : apps/dartchain-frontend/Dart
# Build command      : npm ci && npm run build:cloudflare
# Build output dir   : dist/browser
# Build variable     : BACKEND_URL=...
